    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Given a sequence of integers representing the heights of a mountain range and an integer <var>k</var>, output every peak.<br>A height is considered a peak if it is <strong>strictly greater</strong> than both of its immediate neighbors by at least <var>k</var>.<br>The first and last integers can never be peaks because they have only one neighbor.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1: </strong>An integer <var>n</var> for the number of heights.<br><strong>Line 2:</strong> <var>h</var> a space-separated integers representing the heights of a mountain range.<br><strong>Line 3:</strong> An integer <var>k</var> for the minimum required difference from each neighboring height.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> All peaks in their original order, separated by spaces. If there are no peaks, output <const>NONE</const>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">0 &lt; <var>n</var> &lt; 10<br>0 &lt; <var>h</var> &lt; 1000<br>0 &lt; <var>k</var> &lt; 100</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">7\n1 6 2 7 3 9 4\n3</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">6 7 9</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
